# Ayaka Shenhe Kazuha Xilonen. ~21s Rot. Ayaka Hypercarry with 87% RES Shred. 2 Skills per rotation from all team members. Xilonen uses burst every rotation.

# Team
ayaka char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
